@startuml
title Bargaining State Machine

skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> OPEN
OPEN --> CUSTOMER_OFFERED : customer submits offer\nif bargaining enabled and attempts remain
OPEN --> LOCKED_ATTEMPTS_EXHAUSTED : 3 attempts reached

CUSTOMER_OFFERED --> ACCEPTED : merchant accepts offer
CUSTOMER_OFFERED --> REJECTED : merchant rejects offer
CUSTOMER_OFFERED --> MERCHANT_COUNTERED : merchant counters
CUSTOMER_OFFERED --> EXPIRED : offer expires

MERCHANT_COUNTERED --> ACCEPTED : customer accepts counter
MERCHANT_COUNTERED --> REJECTED : customer rejects counter
MERCHANT_COUNTERED --> EXPIRED : counter expires

REJECTED --> OPEN : attempts remain
REJECTED --> LOCKED_ATTEMPTS_EXHAUSTED : no attempts remain

ACCEPTED --> EXPIRED : 24-hour price lock expires
ACCEPTED --> [*] : lock consumed at checkout

LOCKED_ATTEMPTS_EXHAUSTED --> [*]
EXPIRED --> [*]

note right of ACCEPTED
Accepted price locks are scoped to
customer, seller, product/variant,
and expire after 24 hours.
Historical accepted minimums remain stored.
end note

@enduml

